message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Amlak Man: a Persian voice/LLM-assisted real-estate listing manager with a reproducible evaluation harness"
abstract: "Multi-tenant PHP/MySQL web application for Persian real-estate agencies with a voice-to-structured-listing pipeline (Whisper-large-v3 transcription, LLM field extraction constrained to a 26-field allow-list) and an academic evaluation harness (word-level Levenshtein WER, field-level micro P/R/F1 with predeclared scoring rules and a 50-case Persian gold set). B.Sc. thesis software artefact."
